  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir for 1 minute",
    "Add the chickpeas, nutella mixture, and chopped almonds, and stir to combine",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes",
    "Stir occasionally to prevent burning",
    "Serve hot over couscous or rice"
